      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "For transition metals with a coordination number of 4, two different geometries are possible: tetrahedral or square planar. In tetrahedral complexes such as [Zn(CN)"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "4"
              },
              {
                "text": "]"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "2−"
              },
              {
                "text": ", each of the ligand pairs forms an angle of approximately 109.5°. In square planar complexes, such as [Pt(NH"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "3"
              },
              {
                "text": ")"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": "Cl], each ligand has two other ligands at 90° angles (called the "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "cis"
              },
              {
                "text": " positions) and one additional ligand at a 180° angle, in the "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "trans"
              },
              {
                "text": " position. Unlike main-group elements, where these geometries can be predicted from VSEPR theory, predicting whether a complex will be tetrahedral or square planar requires a more detailed examination of transition metal orbitals and is not discussed here."
              }
            ],
            "id": "3800866648",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "caption": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "Transition metals with a coordination number of 4 can adopt a tetrahedral geometry "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "(a)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " as in K"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "[Zn(CN)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "4"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "] or a square planar geometry "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "(b)"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": " as shown in [Pt(NH"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": ")"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "Cl"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "]."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "184909619",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "r2f4fxsm8uyg3pr",
                "text": ""
              }
            ],
            "display": "block",
            "id": "2322327968",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/97/973266D82F5D38925CAEB65DE448E4C3/coord_num_4_examples.jpeg",
            "type": "img",
            "width": 475
